---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy & Triage Disclosure | DigiiState HQ">
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 bg-white text-slate-800">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-black mb-8 border-b-4 border-blue-600 inline-block">Privacy Policy & Disclosures</h1>
		
		<div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter">1. Service Nature & Liability</h2>
			<p>
				DigiiState operates as an independent lead referral and marketing brokerage. We build and rank digital assets to connect consumers with local service providers. DigiiState is NOT a licensed [Plumbing/Septic/Legal] firm. All services are performed by independent third-party contractors ("Renters") who lease marketing space from our network. DigiiState assumes no liability for the physical work, advice, or conduct of these independent providers.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter">2. AI Triage & Call Recording</h2>
			<p>
				To ensure the highest quality of service for our neighbors, all calls placed to our tracking numbers and all forms submitted through our platform are processed by AI Triage systems. These systems transcribe and summarize inquiries for professional routing. By using this site or calling our numbers, you provide express consent to this recording and processing for quality assurance purposes.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter">3. Data Usage</h2>
			<p>
				We collect your name, phone number, and service location for the sole purpose of connecting you with a qualified local provider in your area. We do not sell your data to third-party marketing lists outside of our exclusive partner network.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
